  "description": "Comment- and formatting-preserving JSONC reader plus an edit-based writer.\n\n      Writes by replacing the minimal text span for each changed path rather than\n      re-serializing the document, so comments, blank lines, key order, indentation\n      style, and line endings survive a save untouched — they are never rewritten.\n\n      Framework-only by design: no package references. It is a text-editing\n      component, and staying dependency-free is what keeps it testable in isolation\n      and safe to reason about, since a bug here corrupts user config.",
